WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.200
I just wanted to take a few seconds out to

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.240
wish you guys all the best for the upcoming exam season!

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.670
Now I know that you guys would have heard
that good grades are not everything!

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.600
Well I agree that good grades are not everything,

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.759
but I wouldn’t say that they’re not important at all.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.600
If you do well, it will definitely help you
in life,

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:22.240
but if you don’t end up doing well, it’s NOT the end of the world.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:27.120
You guys know that at Don’t Memorise, we’ve
not really taught learners for marks!

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.180
But if you score well AFTER understanding
concepts it will really make us happy.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:35.140
Also, I’m not going to give you tips on
what you should do during or before your exams.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.540
I’m sure plenty of people have already told
you that.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:40.520
However, there’s ONE thing I’d like to
tell all of you!

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.520
RELAX.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.140
You will do well and it will work out great
in the end!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:47.480
So I’m looking forward to hearing about
how your preparations are going, and don’t

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.250
forget to tell me how you guys did in your
exams!

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.680
All the very best!

